  "title": [
    "[Helgreth's Tavern, Taproom]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Boisterous laughter erupts often from the congregation of imbibing patrons seated at Helgreth's tables.  A scattering of flickering beeswax candles glimmer off the numerous brass fixtures and pristine inverted glassware suspended above the polished bar.  In their starched uniforms, off-duty military officers traverse the tumult of the taproom as they come and go from a plush sanguine velvet curtain marked by a heraldic Vaalorian buckler overhead."
  ],
